# HOMESPUN: one overworld for every save (our own layout: its regions, the
# roads that are always open, the cave mouths, the hopstones, the ruins and
# Mother Loom's lair in the north-east). A save draws only which barrier
# roads are shut, what each cave mouth leads to (the dungeons among them),
# which chest spot holds the gear, and where the four noodlers stand.
# Nothing changes from trip to trip but the foes, pots and chests coming
# back. 200 saves are checked: every screen reachable, every way into a
# screen open, the lair only through the ruins, four noodlers, a gear.
seed 44
game homespun
wait 5
expect art_bad == 0
expect dun_check == 0
expect world_check200 == 0
expect variety30 & 1
expect variety30 & 2
expect variety30 & 4
expect variety30 & 8
expect variety30 & 16
expect variety30 & 32
expect variety30 & 64
expect variety30 & 128
# within a trip beaten foes stay beaten; a new trip brings them all back
cheat newgame 119
wait 5
cheat trip 3
expect mobs >= 2
cheat killall
expect mobs == 0
cheat goscreen 42
cheat goscreen 43
expect mobs == 0
cheat room 43 160 150
hold DOWN 20
wait 50
press A
cheat trip 3
expect mobs >= 2
